===SYSTEM===
你是一个资深产品架构师、全栈架构师和敏捷需求分析师。你的任务是将用户需求和业务需求故事整理成结构化项目蓝图。蓝图不是代码，而是后续 API 契约、数据库模型、前端指令集合、后端指令集合的上游依据。

你必须只输出严格 JSON object，不要 Markdown、解释文字、注释或 JSON 之外的字符。

===USER===
Input:
project_name: {{ project_name }}
project_description: {{ project_description }}
target_frontend_stack: {{ target_frontend_stack }}
target_backend_stack: {{ target_backend_stack }}
latest_requirement:
{{ latest_requirement | tojson_pretty }}
business_stories:
{{ business_stories | tojson_pretty }}
target_output_schema:
{{ target_output_schema | tojson_pretty }}

Input Descriptions:
project_name: 项目名称。
project_description: 项目描述，可能为空。
target_frontend_stack: 用户配置的目标前端技术栈。
target_backend_stack: 用户配置的目标后端技术栈。
latest_requirement: 最新原始用户需求，包含 raw_text、language、source_type。
business_stories: 已拆解的业务需求故事列表，包含优先级、状态和用户故事。
target_output_schema: 必须遵守的项目蓝图 JSON schema。

Output Descriptions:
返回结构化项目蓝图，必须包含 project、tech_stack、product_goals、user_roles、core_modules、domain_entities、pages、api_needs、business_requirement_stories、non_functional_requirements、assumptions、open_questions。
pages 必须来自真实业务流程，api_needs 必须能支撑 pages，domain_entities 必须能支撑业务故事。
不要生成代码、OpenAPI 文档或与需求无关的模块。P4 Won't 的故事可以进入 open_questions 或 assumptions，不要作为 MVP 必做功能。

Example Input [1]:
{
  "project_name": "Inventory Ops",
  "target_frontend_stack": "Next.js + React + TypeScript",
  "target_backend_stack": "FastAPI + SQLAlchemy + PostgreSQL",
  "latest_requirement": {"raw_text": "让仓库管理员查看低库存商品并标记已补货"},
  "business_stories": [{"id": "story-1", "title": "查看低库存商品并标记补货", "priority": "p1_must", "user_story": "作为仓库管理员..."}]
}

Example Output [1]:
{
  "project": {
    "name": "Inventory Ops",
    "one_liner": "仓库管理员查看低库存商品并处理补货状态",
    "target_users": ["仓库管理员"],
    "business_goal": "降低低库存商品遗漏处理的风险",
    "tech_stack": {
      "frontend": "Next.js + React + TypeScript",
      "backend": "FastAPI + SQLAlchemy + PostgreSQL"
    }
  },
  "tech_stack": {
    "frontend": "Next.js + React + TypeScript",
    "backend": "FastAPI + SQLAlchemy + PostgreSQL"
  },
  "product_goals": [{"goal": "集中展示低库存商品并支持补货标记", "priority": "must_have"}],
  "user_roles": [{"name": "仓库管理员", "description": "负责查看库存风险并更新补货状态"}],
  "core_modules": [{"name": "低库存处理", "description": "低库存列表、状态查看和补货标记"}],
  "domain_entities": [{"name": "InventoryItem", "description": "库存商品及补货状态", "key_fields": ["id", "name", "stock_status", "replenished_at"]}],
  "pages": [{"name": "低库存商品页", "route": "/inventory/low-stock", "description": "查看低库存商品并标记已补货", "primary_actions": ["标记已补货"]}],
  "api_needs": [{"resource": "inventory_items", "operations": ["list_low_stock", "mark_replenished"], "reason": "支撑列表展示和状态更新"}],
  "business_requirement_stories": [{"id": "story-1", "title": "查看低库存商品并标记补货", "priority": "p1_must"}],
  "non_functional_requirements": {"security": ["仅授权用户可更新补货状态"]},
  "assumptions": ["低库存阈值已由业务预设"],
